- ##### Low Effort - *harvest-only* 

  Fully automated for effortless fresh produce. Simply plug in, harvest, and savour the results.

- ##### Moderate Effort - *guided involvement* 
 
  For those who enjoy some hands-on time (15-30 minutes/week), with smart tech to simplify the process.

- ##### High Effort - *hands-on mastery*  

  For dedicated growers who love involvement (3-6 hours/week) and experimenting with their setup.

